<div id="heroT"><div class="kick" style="color:#F5B27A">Software · AI automation · Networks · Legal tech</div><h1>The software behind how your business runs.</h1><p>We build, connect and maintain the systems that move an order, a case or a support email from start to finish.</p><button class="btn o" data-go="services">Explore services</button></div>
