about(){LBR=[];return `<section class="sec"><div class="kick">About</div><h1 style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,56px);max-width:820px">Engineers who build, connect and look after software.</h1><div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start;margin-top:26px"><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--mu);max-width:640px">MeriCloud is a remote-first software engineering company: custom software, AI automation, network and cloud work, and legal technology, for businesses, organisations and individuals. We publish only clients, products and results we can stand behind.</p>${th(["About","","Engineers working through a design together.","team"])}</div><h2 style="margin:44px 0 0;font-size:32px">How we think about building software</h2><div class="g4"><div class="box"><h3>Fix before replace</h3><p>Most businesses already have software. We improve what works before proposing a rewrite.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Small releases</h3><p>Working slices you can try beat a big reveal after months of silence.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Design for failure</h3><p>Backups, alerts and recovery plans are part of the first release, not an afterthought.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Hand-over ready</h3><p>Documentation and clean code so you are never locked in to us.</p></div></div></section>`},
